  "methodology_correction": {
    "issue": "The paper's fold-mean TRAPEZOIDAL PR-AUC is arm-dependent optimistic: trapezoidal interpolation over-credits heavily-tied score distributions. The paper RF emits 1546 distinct scores over 1689 statements (near-continuous), the LLMs only ~420-498 (heavily tied), so trapezoidal inflates LLM PR-AUC by +0.010 to +0.014 while barely touching the RF.",
